      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#1a1c2c;--card:#2a2d3e;--accent:#5d8aa8;--text:#f0e6d2;--error:#ff6b6b}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\nbody{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:system-ui,monospace;font-size:16px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:100vh;padding:16px}\n.card{background:var(--card);padding:24px;border:4px solid var(--accent);border-radius:8px;max-width:400px;width:100%;box-shadow:8px 8px 0 #0f111a}\n.card h1{font-size:20px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}\n.field{margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\nlabel{font-size:14px;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}\ninput,select{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);border:2px solid var(--accent);padding:10px;font-size:16px;font-family:inherit;border-radius:4px;outline:none;width:100%}\ninput:focus,select:focus{border-color:var(--text);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--text)}\nbutton{background:var(--accent);color:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--accent);padding:12px;font-size:16px;font-family:inherit;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:4px;width:100%;transition:transform .1s,background .2s;font-weight:bold}\nbutton:hover{background:var(--text);border-color:var(--text)}\nbutton:active{transform:translate(2px,2px)}\nbutton:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--text);outline-offset:2px}\n#result{background:var(--bg);border:2px dashed var(--accent);padding:16px;text-align:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:16px;min-height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;word-break:break-all}\n#result.error{color:var(--error);border-color:var(--error)}\n@media(max-width:360px){.card{padding:16px}button,input,select{font-size:16px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n<h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n<div class=\"field\">\n<label for=\"left\">Left Number</label>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"left\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5.5\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n<label for=\"right\">Right Number</label>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"right\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n<label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n<select id=\"operation\">\n<option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n<option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n<option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n<option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<button id=\"calculate\">Calculate</button>\n<div id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst leftEl = document.getElementById('left');\nconst rightEl = document.getElementById('right');\nconst opEl = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\nconst calcBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n\nfunction showError() {\n  resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n  resultEl.classList.add('error');\n}\n\nfunction showResult(value) {\n  resultEl.textContent = String(value);\n  resultEl.classList.remove('error');\n}\n\nfunction calculate() {\n  const leftRaw = leftEl.value.trim();\n  const rightRaw = rightEl.value.trim();\n  if (leftRaw === '' || rightRaw === '') return showError();\n  const left = Number(leftRaw);\n  const right = Number(rightRaw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(left) || !Number.isFinite(right)) return showError();\n  const op = opEl.value;\n  let result;\n  switch (op) {\n    case 'add': result = left + right; break;\n    case 'subtract': result = left - right; break;\n    case 'multiply': result = left * right; break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (right === 0) return showError();\n      result = left / right;\n      break;\n    default: return showError();\n  }\n  if (!Number.isFinite(result)) return showError();\n  showResult(result);\n}\n\ncalcBtn.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n[leftEl, rightEl, opEl].forEach(el => el.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') calculate();\n}));\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Calculator\n\nA pixel-style two-number calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline with no external dependencies.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two number inputs (`#left`, `#right`) supporting negative and decimal values\n- Operation selector (`#operation`) with add, subtract, multiply, and divide\n- Calculate button (`#calculate`) and live result display (`#result`)\n- Rejects empty or non-finite inputs and division by zero, showing exactly `Error`\n- Keyboard accessible: press Enter in any input to calculate\n- Responsive pixel-art design with a cohesive palette\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter the left and right numbers.\n3. Choose an operation.\n4. Click **Calculate** or press Enter.\n5. The numeric result appears in the output box. Invalid input shows `Error`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — complete app (HTML, CSS, JS inline)\n- `README.md` — this file\n\nNo packages, network requests, or storage are used.",
      "description": ""
    }
